    "Built by reading each case's IOC text (or, where none exists, the flows).",
    "malicious_ips / malicious_domains: attacker-controlled infrastructure",
    "  (C2, payload delivery, exfiltration). Domains are mapped to IPs using",
    "  the capture's own DNS answers and TLS SNI (tshark), for labeling only.",
    "ambiguous_ips / ambiguous_domains: shared or legitimate services that the",
    "  malware used (CDNs, Dropbox, Telegram, IP-lookup sites, compromised",
    "  sites). Flows to them are EXCLUDED from training and evaluation.",
    "Every other flow in the capture is labeled benign background.",
    "Email-header IPs and reference links in the IOC files are ignored."
  ],
